<EducationCategory/05faae3c-603d-11f1-8990-005056bdd76e> a :EducationCategory ;
  :category 10 ;
  :categoryDescription "First Professional Degree - awarded for completion of a program that: requires at least 2 years of college work before entrance into the program, includes a total of at least 6 academic years of work to complete, and provides all remaining academic requirements to begin practice in a profession." ;
